<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"><title>Your email address changed</title></head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#f4f4f7;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">
  <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="padding:32px 16px;"><tr><td align="center">
    <table width="560" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#fff;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;">
      <tr><td align="center" style="background:#111827;padding:24px;"><h1 style="margin:0;color:#fff;font-size:24px;">TheRentalz</h1></td></tr>
      <tr><td style="padding:32px;color:#374151;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;">
        <p>Hi <%= name %>,</p>
        <% if (changed) { %>
        <p>The email address on your TheRentalz account was changed to <strong><%= newEmail %></strong>. Your other sessions will end shortly, and you sign in with the new address from now on.</p>
        <p>If this wasn't you, contact us straight away.</p>
        <% } else { %>
        <p>Someone asked to change the email address on your TheRentalz account to <strong><%= newEmail %></strong>. Nothing changes until that address confirms.</p>
        <p>If this wasn't you, change your password now.</p>
        <% } %>
      </td></tr>
      <tr><td align="center" style="padding:16px;color:#9ca3af;font-size:12px;">&copy; <%= currentYear %> TheRentalz. All rights reserved.</td></tr>
    </table>
  </td></tr></table>
</body>
</html>
